# The pictures of step-links.md: a block with a hole, as a STEP file
# (testdata/step/shapes/box_hole.step), linked into an empty model
# saved beside it, first as a reference mesh and then as a solid.
file $testdata/step/host.tlspr
menu File|Open...
file $testdata/step/shapes/box_hole.step
menu Assembly|Link / Assemble...
view rotated
menu View|Zoom To Fit
cursor off
shot step-links-1-mesh
cursor on
twmove 289 172
mark 270 162 75 22 tw
shot step-links-2-read-as tw
twdown L 289 172
twup L 289 172
answer ok
menu Analyze|Check Solid
cursor off
shot step-links-3-solid
